WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:05.620
A plugin is a ready-made set of instructions that turns an AI tool into your helper for one job.

2
00:00:06.370 --> 00:00:11.508
Way 1, no code. Open a store item and tap Copy plugin.

3
00:00:12.258 --> 00:00:21.524
Step 2. Open ChatGPT, Gemini, or Grok. Paste it into custom instructions, or a Gem in Gemini.

4
00:00:22.274 --> 00:00:27.244
Step 3. Try the example from the page, then make it yours.

5
00:00:27.994 --> 00:00:40.764
Way 2, with code, is optional. Download the plugin and open the API example. Paste your own key where it says your API key, then run it. Never share your key.

6
00:00:41.514 --> 00:00:45.884
Step 5. To sell your own, fill in the Build form.

7
00:00:46.634 --> 00:00:54.844
Step 6. Set a rent price, a buy price, or both. Tap Post to Store, then share your link.

8
00:00:55.594 --> 00:00:59.436
That's it. Copy it, paste it, try it.
